Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}给 穿梭机马上就要出发了\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}はい シャトルはすぐに出ますよ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}但是\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}でも
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}你是个男孩子啊\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}あなたは男の子よ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}现在才进行太空体验都有点晚了\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}宇宙を体験するのは遅いぐらい
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}妈妈和倩敏呢\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}ママとチェーミンは
