Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}这场仗不会打很久\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}今度の戦争は長くはないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}很快就能赶过去的\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}すぐに追いかけられるって
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}这位先生不是这么说了吗\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}ここの人も言ってるでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.72,0:08:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}真的吗\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}本当だね
