Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}那样是无法破坏的\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}あれじゃ破壊できない
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}依然在向地球下降\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}依然 地球に降下中
