Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}新吉恩万岁!\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}ネオ·ジオン 万歳！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}虽然得到了出发批准\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}発進許可は出ましたが
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}副参谋长\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}参謀次官
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}行程中可能会从疑似陨石的物体附近通过\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}隕石と思われるものの近くを通過します
