Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}意外地靠北边啊\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}意外と北に寄ってるな
