Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.97,0:14:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}是啊 那可不行\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}そうよ ダメよ
