Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}这样根本就像个小丑\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}これでは 道化だよ
