Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}不 是作战长官\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}いえ 作戦士官殿
