Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.18,1:43:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}你才是\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}貴様こそ
