Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.61,1:44:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}时间花得太多了\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}時間がかかりすぎるぞ
