Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.34,1:47:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}如果没有你\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}貴様がいなければ
