Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.70,1:48:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}开什么玩笑\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}ふざけるな
