Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.30,1:49:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}是\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}はい
