Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.85,1:52:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}但仅凭那样的机体…\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}しかし その機体じゃ
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.12,1:52:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}就连基拉·多加也…\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}ギラ·ドーガまで
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.83,1:52:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}不行的啊\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}ムリだよ
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.71,1:52:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}大家 退下\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}みんな 退れ
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.87,1:52:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK}{\fs60}这可关乎地球会不会荒废\N{\fnRounded Mgen+ 2pp regular}{\fs50}{\blur2}地球がダメになるか ならないかなんだ
